Setting up machine IP address:
1.open terminal:
  sudo nano /etc/netplan/01-netcfg.yaml

  network:
  version: 2
  renderer: NetworkManager
  ethernets:
    enp0s3:
      dhcp4: no
      addresses:
        - 192.168.1.3/24
    enp0s8:
      dhcp4: yes

  []^S
  []^X

  sudo chmod 600 /etc/netplan/01-netcfg.yaml
  sudo netplan apply  

2.if there are multiple connection profiles how to delete them:
  nmcli connection show
  nmcli connection delete "Wired connection 1"

Installing libs:
1.open terminal:
  sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y wireshark tcpdump iproute2 curl netcat-openbsd dnsutils whois ipcalc python3 dsniff ettercap-text-only
  sudo snap install curl
